    35	**Stateless observation-only policy.** Actions use explicit current-observation
    36	tokens. No between-turn hidden state, temporal memory training or new history
    37	tokens. Within-turn autoregressive prefix state resets on each observation.
    38	Opponent identity may not condition actor/critic inputs, embeddings, heads,
    39	losses, rewards, normalization or checkpoint selection. Collection mixes and
    40	panel labels are allowed without exposing identity to the model. Reject
    41	prohibited checkpoint state. Follow the [adopted constraints](cookbook/decisions/the-policy-is-stateless-and-observation-only.md).
