   643	Create `engine_rs/tests/replay_parity.rs` with the following. It uses only retained public APIs and existing dependencies. `gzip -dc` is an explicit test prerequisite and a failed decompression is a hard error. No shell interpolation or new executable target is involved.
   644	
   645	```rust
   646	use kaggriculture_engine::{ATTRIB_FIELDS, Config, ECON_FIELDS, ECON_PASS, Game, TraceHeader};
   647	use serde_json::{Value, json};
