    28	- Carried onto the working branch: `cookbook/`, `.claude/`, `.codex/`, `AGENTS.md` (with the `CLAUDE.md` symlink), `kaggriculture-v3.base`, `ops/pre-commit` (Git uses `core.hooksPath=ops`), `ops/cookbook-setup-checks.md`, and `.gitignore` (the starter's rules plus bulk and credential exclusions).
