   460	/// Native Myolie grammar DFA. Little-endian header: magic 0x4D534731, ABI 1,
   461	/// node count, start node 0, edge count (five u32). Each node is four u32:
   462	/// slot, pending HIRE requests before this frame, edge offset, vocabulary width.
