     2	
     3	Construction validates and deduplicates native plans before bounded tensor upload.
     4	Hot methods use tensor indexing only. Node -1 is terminal (dummy choice zero);
     5	invalid nodes, wrong slots and illegal choices yield no support / poison node -2.
     6	Slot zero retains the native 241-wide actor vocabulary; callers with smaller heads
