+**Scratch-only files:** Claude prepares `/Users/poonszesen/kg-v3-grammar-reference-1.2` at the pinned reference commit. Recorder appends the hashed test module to that worktree's `engine_rs/src/ffi.rs`, with pre-edit blob and exact patch retained under the implementation receipt's `oracle/scratch/`; request/response JSONL and build output remain working artifacts. The scratch checkout is **not** `/Users/poonszesen/kg-v3` (active model work) or this vendored `engine_rs/`. No reference tracked change is committed. The recorder refuses a dirty scratch tree before setup, a wrong commit, or a mismatched original blob.
+
+### Why this location and compilation work
+
