+## 7. Risks
+
+- **L4 / feature graph:** a normal production root → engine edge unifies `serde_json/arbitrary_precision` and may break the test-only internally tagged float decode. Separate-package tests do not qualify that future graph. Keep numeric features, reopen with the narrow fixture repair and generation tests at the actual dependency addition. Evidence: `W:briefs/1.1-rules-kernel.md:124–153`; `W:src/rules_engine/generation.rs:691–697`.
