+### 5.3 Implement transitions and compare every local support
+
+Question: do tables and runtime transitions agree over every reachable local condition, including market digit support and capacity? Inputs: fixed constants, reference-derived header tables, admitted prefixes. Stop at exact boolean/transition equality, not a statistical tolerance.
