+## 2. Interfaces
+
+These are proposed exact signatures, not declarations already implemented. No public API retains “myolie” names. Use `Result<_, String>` with field/frame/slot/value in errors, matching `W:src/rl/action_spec.rs:25–89,160–169`; Task 1.4 maps admission errors to `PyValueError`, as `W:src/rl.rs:139–145` does. No panics, unchecked casts or fallback-to-PASS for bad external input.
+
+### Constants and typed tokens
+
+```rust
+pub const MAX_ACTORS: usize = 241;
+pub const MAX_ORDERS: usize = 10;
+pub const MAX_FRAMES: usize = MAX_ACTORS + MAX_ORDERS + 1; // 252
+pub const SLOTS: usize = 12;
+pub const TOKENS_PER_SEAT: usize = MAX_FRAMES * SLOTS; // 3024
+pub const DEFAULT_HIRE_LIMIT: i64 = 241;
+pub const QUANTITY_BASE: i64 = 32;
+pub const MAX_QUANTITY: i64 = 1023;
+pub const GRAMMAR_TABLES_VERSION: u32 = 1;
+
+#[repr(usize)]
+pub enum Slot {
+    UnitActor = 0, UnitKind = 1, UnitTarget = 2, UnitItem = 3,
+    UnitQuantityPresent = 4, UnitQuantityHigh = 5, UnitQuantity = 6,
+    MarketKind = 7, MarketItem = 8, MarketQuantityHigh = 9,
