+| Task 1.4 native step | `tokens np.int64 [E,2,252,12]`, `lengths np.int64 [E,2]`; borrowed seat slice goes to `decode` unchanged. |
+| Task 1.3/1.4 observation | `order_limits int64 [E,2]`; `can_act bool [E,2,252]` from `write_can_act`; own actor count from legal state. |
+| Task 2.3 `GrammarTables` | The eight Rust fields above, same names/shapes, `torch.bool`; `market_quantity` serves **both** slots 9 and 10. |
+| Task 2.3 runtime context | `actor_counts int64 [B]`, `order_limits int64 [B]`, scalar `hire_limit=241`, `live bool [B]`, `B=2E`; apply phase, queue availability, HIRE prefix and STOP marginalization overlays (H:54–83). |
